{% set output_format_description = "a brief callout (1-2 sentences) highlighting the most critical risk identified regarding patch delays, suitable for a distinct callout box" %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Review the data summary and chart insight provided below for "{{ section_title }}". This section examines the relationship between patch/disclosure delay (using NVD publication as a proxy) and vulnerability severity (CVSS score).
Identify the *single most significant risk factor* revealed by this analysis. Focus particularly on vulnerabilities that represent a high risk due to a combination of severity and delay (e.g., high CVSS scores coupled with notable delays).
Craft a concise callout (1-2 sentences maximum) stating this key risk clearly, emphasizing the potential window of exposure.
